{
    "title": "\u6f2b\u753b \u201d\uff32\uff45\uff4e\uff54\uff41\u201d\u30de\u30f3\u30ac \u30ec\u30f3\u30bf\u30eb\u6f2b\u753b\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea",
    "description": "Manga app [Renta!] Rent manga so you can read it at a great price!\r\nOver 9.5 million members! Over 820,000 manga and light novels!\r\nRent the manga you want to read!\r\n\r\n[Renta!] has a wide variety of manga genres\u2605\r\nGirl manga, boy manga, youth manga\r\nBoys Love (BL), Teens Love (TL)\r\nYou're sure to find the popular manga you want to read, including ladies' comics, horror comics, gourmet comics, Harlequin comics, romance comics, manga based on anime, and manga based on dramas!\r\n\r\nmoreover! Renta! Original, an original full-color comic that can only be read here, and you can read one episode for free!\r\nAt Renta!, popular manga are updated daily!\r\n\r\n\r\n[Renta!] App features\u2605\r\n\u25c6Rental function\r\nWith Renta!, you can rent and read at a great price!\r\nThis is a manga app that can be used to suit your reading style, such as 48-hour rental when you want to read quickly and at a good price, or unlimited rental for manga that you want to read carefully or reread when a new publication comes out.\r\n\r\n\u25c6Vertical text\r\nThis is a new manga format created by Renta! ``Tatekomi'' is a manga that has been restructured so that each frame, including dialogue, fits perfectly on a smartphone's vertical screen, making it comfortable to read with vertical scrolling.\r\nEnjoy the best manga experience with \"Renta!\"\r\n\r\n\u25c6Save function that can be read offline\r\nIf you download and save it over Wi-Fi, you can read it anywhere without worrying about giga!\r\nThis is a manga app that becomes your bookshelf and you can read it whenever you want.\r\n\r\n\u25c6Viewer that is easy to read both vertically and horizontally\r\nYou can enjoy manga in your favorite way, whether it's vertically or horizontally, without any ads!\r\n\r\n\u25c6Original full color manga\r\nYou can read the first chapter of an original manga specifically for smartphones that is easy to read for free!\r\n\r\n\u25c6Don't worry if you change the model! [Renta! Membership System]\r\nYou can continue reading rented manga even after changing your device!\r\nThe more you use it, the higher your \"Renta! Rank\" will be, and the more you save.\r\nSave even more with the ``Renta! Stamps'' that you receive every day.\r\n*By logging in with the same member information, you can continue to use the service in the same way from your smartphone, tablet, or PC.\r\n\r\n\u3010Notes\u3011\r\n*Some products may not be available for 48 hours.\r\nThe number of points required varies depending on the product.\r\nPoints for renting manga are sold starting at 110 yen (tax included).\r\n\r\n[You can read popular manga like this on Renta!: Latest manga ranking]\r\n\u25cfShounen manga\r\nReincarnated Musou of the Sage in Another World ~The strongest in the other world with his game knowledge~\r\n[Progress Islands (GA Novel/SB Creative)/Sanjusanju/Kaito Shibano/Square Enix]\r\nShonen Manga: Summoning/Reincarnation: Manga UP! : Gangan Comics UP!\r\nThe crazy thing in my heart\r\n[Norio Sakurai/Akita Shoten] Shonen Manga: Romantic Comedy: Manga Cross: Shonen Champion Comics\r\nI've joined the demon! Iruma-kun\r\n[Osamu Nishi/Akita Shoten] Animation: Weekly Shonen Champion\r\n\r\n\u25cfYouth manga\r\nBEASTARS\r\n[Paru Itagaki/Akita Shoten] Youth manga: Animal comics: Animation: Stage adaptation: Shonen Champion Comics\r\nHina Festival\r\n[Masao Otake / KADOKAWA] Youth manga: Yakuza/underworld: Everyday life: Animation: HARTA COMIX\r\nThe man with a thousand skills has started summoning beasts in another world!\r\n[Shibuya Daikon / Bunzaburo Nagano / Arata Shindo / Hifumi Shobo] Youth Manga: Summoning/Reincarnation: Comic Polka\r\n\r\n\u25cfGirls manga\r\nseamstress maiden\r\n[Zeroki/Miho Takeoka/Yuni Yukimura/KADOKAWA] Girls' Manga: Summoning/Reincarnation: Kadokawa Comics Ace\r\nLove is difficult for otaku\r\n[Fujita/Ichijinsha] Girls' manga: Romantic comedy: Office: Animation: Live-action film adaptation: comic POOL\r\nIt's called love, so hug me\r\n[Ryo Narumi/Solmare Editorial Office/Soiree in Love] Girls' Manga: Love: Soiree in Love\r\n\r\nWe also have a wide variety of other genres! Check out the rental manga you want to read! Search for your favorite manga and novels!\r\n\r\n\r\n[Recommended for those who want to read manga works in this genre]\r\n\u30fbI want to read popular parallel world manga and villainess manga.\r\n\u30fbI want a manga app where I can rent a lot of BL manga.\r\n\u30fbI want to try reading the top popular manga apps on manga apps that also have free manga.\r\n\u30fbI want to rent popular Japanese manga\r\n\u30fbI want to read the scary manga I'm addicted to in my free time\r\n\u30fbI want to search for my favorite manga magazine with an app that allows me to read manga.\r\n\u30fbLooking for popular horror manga for adults\r\n\u30fbI like easy-to-read full-color vertically read manga\r\n\u30fbI want to read popular boys' manga all at once.\r\n\u30fbI want to be able to download my favorite BL manga and view it offline.\r\n\u30fbLooking for a continuation of a popular anime manga that has been made into an anime.\r\n\u30fbI want to know about popular romance manga and manga for women.\r\n\u30fbI want to read all reincarnation comics in a different world.\r\n\u30fbI want to search for interesting manga on a manga app that has popular manga and free manga.\r\n\u30fbI want to read heart-pounding romance manga and girls' manga\r\n\u30fbI want to thoroughly enjoy boys' manga for the first time in a while.\r\n\u30fbI want a manga app that allows me to read a variety of manga, such as boys' manga and scary manga, rather than a romance manga app with a narrow range of genres.\r\n\u30fbI want to get excited with TL manga and BL manga\r\n\u30fbI want to read a lot of my favorite girls' manga and young man's manga with the free manga app.\r\n\u30fbI like manga where adults are reincarnated in another world and start their lives over again.\r\n\u30fbI want to search for girls' comics that I used to read on a comic app.\r\n\u30fbI'm looking for something that allows me to read youth manga in a vertical reading format like Korean manga.\r\n\u30fbI want to read comics from a wide range of genres, such as girls' comics, youth comics, and horror comics.\r\n\u30fbI want a free comic app where I can see manga rankings.\r\n\u30fbI want to search for villainess manga with a free manga app that has many free works.\r\n\u30fbI'm looking for a romance manga app that depicts adult love scenes.\r\n\u30fbI want to use a manga app that can be enjoyed as both a girl's manga app and a boy's manga app.\r\n\u30fbI want to get addicted to scary manga\r\n\u30fbI want to know about popular works in different world manga and reincarnation manga.\r\n\u30fbI'm looking for an anime manga that I liked when I was a child.\r\n\u30fbI want to read manga based on true stories that have been made into manga.\r\n\u30fbLooking for a popular manga app that allows you to select BL manga based on attributes\r\n\u30fbI want to read a lot of popular girls' manga and romance manga at once.\r\n\u30fbI like Korean manga works that can be read in a vertical manga style.\r\n\u30fbI especially like BL manga among Japanese manga.\r\n\u30fbI want to reread old popular manga\r\n\u30fbI want to know about popular comics\r\n\u30fbLooking for cheat manga\r\n\r\n[Recommended for those who want a manga app like this]\r\n\u30fbI want to use a manga app that offers great deals, such as unlimited reading of one episode of original comics for free.\r\n\u30fbI want a popular manga app that makes it easy to read vertical manga\r\n\u30fbI want to use an app that allows me to read manga offline.\r\n\u30fbI'm looking for a manga app that allows me to preview free manga and then rent it.\r\n\u30fbI want a popular comic app with a wide range of genres.\r\n\u30fbI want to know about popular manga apps that have a wide variety of vertically readable manga, like Korean manga.\r\n\u30fbI don't need a manga app where I can read all the volumes, I want a manga app that I can download.\r\n\u30fbI want to kill time with a manga app that allows me to read vertical comics and original comics for free.\r\n\u30fbI want to use a manga app that allows me to enjoy both light novels and manga.\r\n\u30fbI want to start looking for interesting manga works with a trial reading free manga app.\r\n\u30fbI want a manga app that can be rented as well as purchased.\r\n\u30fbI want to check if there is a BL manga I like using the free trial reading manga app.\r\n\u30fbLooking for a free DL manga app that has a wide variety of popular and topical comics\r\n\u30fbI want to choose a manga app that is free to register and allows me to read a lot of manga magazines for girls and boys.\r\n\u30fbI want to use all the free manga apps to register.\r\n\u30fbI want a comic app that I can read without worrying about giga.\r\n\u30fbI want an app that I can download and read manga offline in my spare time.\r\n\u30fbAmong manga apps, I want to choose one that has a wide variety of BL and TL manga.\r\n\u30fbI want to read romance manga and scary manga with a popular manga app that has a wide variety of genres.\r\n\u30fbI want to use a popular manga app that allows me to rent manga books without having to go to a rental store.\r\n\u30fbLooking for something to read famous anime manga\r\n\u30fbI want a free manga app that has everything from everyday gourmet manga to hot sports manga.\r\n\u30fbI want to use a comic app that can be read vertically\r\n\u30fbI want to read all volumes of comics at once\r\n\u30fbI want to rent all volumes from a rental manga app\r\n\u30fbI don't need a free manga app; I want to use a manga app that has popular manga updated every day.\r\n\u30fbI want to read manga without ads\r\n\u30fbI want a manga app that also handles classic manga\r\n\u30fbI want to read manga thoroughly, one volume at a time.\r\n\r\n[Recommended for those who have experience with this! ]\r\n\u30fbThe free manga app I downloaded previously didn't have my favorite girls' manga.\r\n\u30fbIt was a manga app that you could read for free, but I couldn't read the different world manga I was looking for.\r\n\u30fbI thought it was a girls' manga app, but it turned out to be a romance manga app with many works for adults.\r\n\u30fbRead all the manga for free! There were very few free manga apps that claimed to be readable.\r\n\u30fbI like BL manga, but it wasn't listed.\r\n\u30fbIt was a girl's manga app with only manga works that I had read before.\r\n\u30fbWhen I used free comic apps, most of them only had one episode for free.\r\n\u30fbPreviously, when I used an all-you-can-read girls' manga app, all I could find was old manga.\r\n\u30fbManga free app! The manga app that claimed to have only original manga works\r\n\u30fbIt was a manga app that allowed you to read all the volumes, but the number of publications was small.\r\n\u30fbThe free manga app had a lot of advertisements, making it difficult to read the manga.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Manga app [Renta!] Rent manga so you can read it at a great price!<br>Over 9.5 million members! Over 820,000 manga and light novels!<br>Rent the manga you want to read!<br><br>[Renta!] has a wide variety of manga genres\u2605<br>Girl manga, boy manga, youth manga<br>Boys Love (BL), Teens Love (TL)<br>You&#39;re sure to find the popular manga you want to read, including ladies&#39; comics, horror comics, gourmet comics, Harlequin comics, romance comics, manga based on anime, and manga based on dramas!<br><br>moreover! Renta! Original, an original full-color comic that can only be read here, and you can read one episode for free!<br>At Renta!, popular manga are updated daily!<br><br><br>[Renta!] App features\u2605<br>\u25c6Rental function<br>With Renta!, you can rent and read at a great price!<br>This is a manga app that can be used to suit your reading style, such as 48-hour rental when you want to read quickly and at a good price, or unlimited rental for manga that you want to read carefully or reread when a new publication comes out.<br><br>\u25c6Vertical text<br>This is a new manga format created by Renta! ``Tatekomi&#39;&#39; is a manga that has been restructured so that each frame, including dialogue, fits perfectly on a smartphone&#39;s vertical screen, making it comfortable to read with vertical scrolling.<br>Enjoy the best manga experience with &quot;Renta!&quot;<br><br>\u25c6Save function that can be read offline<br>If you download and save it over Wi-Fi, you can read it anywhere without worrying about giga!<br>This is a manga app that becomes your bookshelf and you can read it whenever you want.<br><br>\u25c6Viewer that is easy to read both vertically and horizontally<br>You can enjoy manga in your favorite way, whether it&#39;s vertically or horizontally, without any ads!<br><br>\u25c6Original full color manga<br>You can read the first chapter of an original manga specifically for smartphones that is easy to read for free!<br><br>\u25c6Don&#39;t worry if you change the model! [Renta! Membership System]<br>You can continue reading rented manga even after changing your device!<br>The more you use it, the higher your &quot;Renta! Rank&quot; will be, and the more you save.<br>Save even more with the ``Renta! Stamps&#39;&#39; that you receive every day.<br>*By logging in with the same member information, you can continue to use the service in the same way from your smartphone, tablet, or PC.<br><br>\u3010Notes\u3011<br>*Some products may not be available for 48 hours.<br>The number of points required varies depending on the product.<br>Points for renting manga are sold starting at 110 yen (tax included).<br><br>[You can read popular manga like this on Renta!: Latest manga ranking]<br>\u25cfShounen manga<br>Reincarnated Musou of the Sage in Another World ~The strongest in the other world with his game knowledge~<br>[Progress Islands (GA Novel/SB Creative)/Sanjusanju/Kaito Shibano/Square Enix]<br>Shonen Manga: Summoning/Reincarnation: Manga UP! : Gangan Comics UP!<br>The crazy thing in my heart<br>[Norio Sakurai/Akita Shoten] Shonen Manga: Romantic Comedy: Manga Cross: Shonen Champion Comics<br>I&#39;ve joined the demon! Iruma-kun<br>[Osamu Nishi/Akita Shoten] Animation: Weekly Shonen Champion<br><br>\u25cfYouth manga<br>BEASTARS<br>[Paru Itagaki/Akita Shoten] Youth manga: Animal comics: Animation: Stage adaptation: Shonen Champion Comics<br>Hina Festival<br>[Masao Otake / KADOKAWA] Youth manga: Yakuza/underworld: Everyday life: Animation: HARTA COMIX<br>The man with a thousand skills has started summoning beasts in another world!<br>[Shibuya Daikon / Bunzaburo Nagano / Arata Shindo / Hifumi Shobo] Youth Manga: Summoning/Reincarnation: Comic Polka<br><br>\u25cfGirls manga<br>seamstress maiden<br>[Zeroki/Miho Takeoka/Yuni Yukimura/KADOKAWA] Girls&#39; Manga: Summoning/Reincarnation: Kadokawa Comics Ace<br>Love is difficult for otaku<br>[Fujita/Ichijinsha] Girls&#39; manga: Romantic comedy: Office: Animation: Live-action film adaptation: comic POOL<br>It&#39;s called love, so hug me<br>[Ryo Narumi/Solmare Editorial Office/Soiree in Love] Girls&#39; Manga: Love: Soiree in Love<br><br>We also have a wide variety of other genres! Check out the rental manga you want to read! Search for your favorite manga and novels!<br><br><br>[Recommended for those who want to read manga works in this genre]<br>\u30fbI want to read popular parallel world manga and villainess manga.<br>\u30fbI want a manga app where I can rent a lot of BL manga.<br>\u30fbI want to try reading the top popular manga apps on manga apps that also have free manga.<br>\u30fbI want to rent popular Japanese manga<br>\u30fbI want to read the scary manga I&#39;m addicted to in my free time<br>\u30fbI want to search for my favorite manga magazine with an app that allows me to read manga.<br>\u30fbLooking for popular horror manga for adults<br>\u30fbI like easy-to-read full-color vertically read manga<br>\u30fbI want to read popular boys&#39; manga all at once.<br>\u30fbI want to be able to download my favorite BL manga and view it offline.<br>\u30fbLooking for a continuation of a popular anime manga that has been made into an anime.<br>\u30fbI want to know about popular romance manga and manga for women.<br>\u30fbI want to read all reincarnation comics in a different world.<br>\u30fbI want to search for interesting manga on a manga app that has popular manga and free manga.<br>\u30fbI want to read heart-pounding romance manga and girls&#39; manga<br>\u30fbI want to thoroughly enjoy boys&#39; manga for the first time in a while.<br>\u30fbI want a manga app that allows me to read a variety of manga, such as boys&#39; manga and scary manga, rather than a romance manga app with a narrow range of genres.<br>\u30fbI want to get excited with TL manga and BL manga<br>\u30fbI want to read a lot of my favorite girls&#39; manga and young man&#39;s manga with the free manga app.<br>\u30fbI like manga where adults are rein